      "what": "The baseline states that 'No authentication is required.' The candidate updates this to require sending a key in the `X-API-Key` header on every request.",
      "how": "Before: Clients could make requests without any headers or credentials. After: Every API request must include the `X-API-Key` header; otherwise, the server will likely reject the request (likely with a 401 Unauthorized error).",
